---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Components
description: Web components styled entirely by the token system.
permalink: /components/
---

<p>
  Every component is a Lit element. All API documentation on these pages is
  generated from <code>custom-elements.json</code>, which
  <code>cem analyze</code> extracts from the source — so a table here cannot
  disagree with the code.
</p>

<ul class="card-grid">
  {% for component in components %}
    <li class="card">
      <h2><a href="/components/{{ component.tagName }}/">&lt;{{ component.tagName }}&gt;</a></h2>
      <p>{{ component.summary | truncate(150) }}</p>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
